# File structure (follow Xizmat admin)

Reference: `XIZMAT/xizmat-provider-web/src/features/<name>/`.
Colocate by screen. Do not dump new files as flat `src/admin/FooPage.tsx`.

```
src/pages/<kebab-name>/
  <Name>Page.tsx
  index.ts
  styles.ts
  constants/index.ts
  types/index.ts
  components/
    <PascalName>/
      <PascalName>.tsx
      styles.ts
      index.ts
```

- One component per folder; re-export from `index.ts`.
- Shared helpers/constants live in `src/lib/`, not copied into every page.
- Translations stay as `{ uz, ru, en }` objects in that screen's `constants`.
- New screens follow this layout. When touching a flat admin page, move it into a folder rather than adding more files beside it.
